      "end": 4.2,
      "speaker": "Ada",
      "text": "Morning everyone, let's start with the release timeline for the mobile app."
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "start": 4.5,
      "end": 9.1,
      "speaker": "Ravi",
      "text": "The build is green but the onboarding flow still has two blocking bugs."
