      "start": 9.4,
      "end": 13.8,
      "speaker": "Mei",
      "text": "I can pick up the onboarding bugs today and get fixes in by Friday."
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "start": 14.0,
      "end": 18.6,
      "speaker": "Ada",
      "text": "Great. Let's go with a Friday cutoff for the release candidate then."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "start": 18.9,
      "end": 22.0,
      "speaker": "Ravi",
      "text": "Agreed, Friday works for me for the RC."
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "start": 35.0,
      "end": 40.5,
      "speaker": "Ada",
      "text": "Switching topics, the pricing page redesign has been sitting for a while."
