    {
      "index": 6,
      "start": 41.0,
      "end": 46.3,
      "speaker": "Mei",
      "text": "We decided last sprint to go with the three-tier layout, so I'll finalize the copy."
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "start": 46.6,
      "end": 51.0,
      "speaker": "Ravi",
      "text": "Can you also send the updated mockups to marketing by end of week?"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "start": 51.3,
      "end": 55.8,
      "speaker": "Mei",
      "text": "Sure, I'll send the mockups to marketing by Thursday."
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "start": 70.0,
      "end": 75.2,
      "speaker": "Ada",
      "text": "Last thing, the incident postmortem from last week's outage."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "start": 75.5,
      "end": 81.0,
      "speaker": "Ravi",
      "text": "We need to add better alerting on the payment service, that was the root cause."
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "start": 81.3,
      "end": 86.4,
      "speaker": "Ada",
      "text": "Let's adopt the new alerting playbook and circle back next week on progress."
